#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:319
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_OhYoureTheNewNeighbor"
msgid ""
"Oh, hello. And you are?\p"
"… … … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … … …\p"
"Oh, you're {PLAYER}{KUN}, our new next-door\n"
"neighbor! Hi!\p"
"We have a {STR_VAR_1} about the same\n"
"age as you.\p"
"Our {STR_VAR_1} was excited about making\n"
"a new friend.\p"
"Our {STR_VAR_1} is upstairs, I think.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:331
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_LikeChildLikeFather"
msgid ""
"Like child, like father.\p"
"My husband is as wild about POKéMON\n"
"as our child.\p"
"If he's not at his LAB, he's likely\n"
"scrabbling about in grassy places.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:338
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_TooBusyToNoticeVisit"
msgid ""
"That {RIVAL}!\p"
"I guess our child is too busy with\n"
"POKéMON to notice that you came\l"
"to visit, {PLAYER}{KUN}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:344
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_WentOutToRoute103"
msgid ""
"Oh, {RIVAL} went out to ROUTE 103\n"
"just a little while ago.\p"
"Like father, like child.\n"
"{RIVAL} can't stay quietly at home.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:350
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_ShouldGoHomeEverySoOften"
msgid ""
"I think it's wonderful for people to\n"
"travel with POKéMON.\p"
"But you should go home every so often\n"
"to let your mother know you're okay.\p"
"She might not say it, but I'm sure she\n"
"worries about you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:358
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_MayWhoAreYou"
msgid ""
"Huh?\n"
"Who… Who are you?\p"
"… … … … … … … …\n"
"… … … … … … … …\p"
"Oh, you're {PLAYER}{KUN}.\n"
"So your move was today.\p"
"Um… I'm MAY.\n"
"Glad to meet you!\p"
"I…\n"
"I have this dream of becoming friends\l"
"with POKéMON all over the world.\p"
"I… I heard about you, {PLAYER}{KUN}, from\n"
"my dad, PROF. BIRCH.\p"
"I was hoping that you would be nice,\n"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, and that we could be friends.\p"
"Oh, this is silly, isn't it?\n"
"I… I've just met you, {PLAYER}{KUN}.\p"
"Eheheh…\p"
"Oh, no! I forgot!\p"
"I was supposed to go help Dad catch\n"
"some wild POKéMON!\p"
"{PLAYER}{KUN}, I'll catch you later!$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:382
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_BrendanWhoAreYou"
msgid ""
"Hey!\n"
"You…\p"
"Who are you?\p"
"Oh, you're {PLAYER}, aren't you?\n"
"Moved in next door, right?\p"
"I didn't know that you're a girl.\p"
"Dad, PROF. BIRCH, said that our new\n"
"next-door neighbor is a GYM LEADER's\l"
"kid, so I assumed you'd be a guy.\p"
"My name's BRENDAN.\n"
"So, hi, neighbor!\p"
"Huh? Hey, {PLAYER}, don't you have\n"
"a POKéMON?\p"
"Do you want me to go catch you one?\p"
"Aw, darn, I forgot…\p"
"I'm supposed to go help my dad catch\n"
"some wild POKéMON.\p"
"Some other time, okay?$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LittlerootTown_MaysHouse_1F/scripts.inc:402
msgctxt "RivalsHouse_1F_Text_DoYouHavePokemon"
msgid ""
"Hi, neighbor!\p"
"Do you already have your\n"
"own POKéMON?$"
msgstr ""
